<title>NETHERLANDS: RESEARCH ALERT-ING Barings ups ABN AMRO EPS.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-ING Barings ups ABN AMRO EPS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Nov 25 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    ABN AMRO	  Banking	 112.10  ING Barings</p>
<p>COMMENT: Acquisition of Standard Federal seems positive. We assume it will start contributing earnings from mid-1997. We raise EPS for 1997 and 1998. 12 month price target Dfl 128.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	7.69     NA	 14.6</p>
<p>    1996		   9.16     NA	 12.3</p>
<p>    1997		  10.30     10.10    10.9</p>
<p>    1998		  11.55     11.11     9.7</p>
